#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:1
msgid "Processing pipeline"
msgstr "处理流水线"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor processes local checkpoint directories through explicit"
" inspection, planning, transformation, export, and validation phases."
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor 通过明确的检查、规划、转换、导出和验证阶段处理本地 checkpoint 目录。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:5
msgid "Source checkpoint assumptions"
msgstr "源 checkpoint 假设"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:7
msgid ""
"The input is a local [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/docs) "
"`safetensors` model directory. A typical input contains:"
msgstr "输入是本地 [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/docs) `safetensors` 模型目录。典型输入包含："

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:16
msgid ""
"The tool does not download models. The source checkpoint must already "
"exist on local storage."
msgstr "该工具不会下载模型。源 checkpoint 必须已经存在于本地存储中。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:18
msgid "Inspection phase"
msgstr "检查阶段"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:20
msgid ""
"Inspection reads structural metadata before weights are converted or "
"quantized. It identifies:"
msgstr "检查会在权重转换或量化之前读取结构元数据，并识别："

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:22
msgid "model configuration."
msgstr "模型配置。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:23
msgid "shard index entries."
msgstr "分片索引条目。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:24
msgid "checkpoint weight names."
msgstr "checkpoint 权重名称。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:25
msgid "tensor shapes."
msgstr "张量形状。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:26
msgid "recognized source formats."
msgstr "可识别的源格式。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:27
msgid ""
"selectable linear, attention, MLP, routed expert, and shared expert "
"groups."
msgstr "可选择的 Linear、attention、MLP、路由专家和共享专家分组。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:29
msgid ""
"Inspection is the safest way to decide selectors and detect unfamiliar "
"layouts."
msgstr "检查是确定选择器并检测陌生布局的最安全方式。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:31
msgid "Planning phase"
msgstr "规划阶段"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:33
msgid ""
"Planning combines command-line options and optional recipe values into "
"one processing plan. The plan resolves:"
msgstr "规划会将命令行选项与可选 recipe 值合并为一个处理计划。该计划会解析："

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:35
msgid "selected and excluded weights."
msgstr "选中和排除的权重。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:36
msgid "quantization method."
msgstr "量化方法。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:37
msgid "weight and activation bit widths."
msgstr "权重和激活位宽。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:38
msgid "group or channel strategy."
msgstr "分组或通道策略。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:39
msgid "group size."
msgstr "group size。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:40
msgid "output format."
msgstr "输出格式。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:41
msgid "calibration settings when required."
msgstr "需要时使用的校准设置。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:43
msgid ""
"Dry-run mode stops after plan validation. This makes it useful for "
"checking selectors and constraints before writing large outputs."
msgstr "空运行模式会在计划验证后停止，因此适合在写入大型输出之前检查选择器和约束。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:45
msgid "Transformation phase"
msgstr "转换阶段"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:47
msgid "The transformation phase operates on selected weights:"
msgstr "转换阶段作用于选中的权重："

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:49
msgid "conversion turns recognized MXFP4 or block FP8 tensors into BF16."
msgstr "转换会将可识别的 MXFP4 或块 FP8 张量转为 BF16。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:50
msgid "MSE quantization creates INT4 or INT8 weight representations."
msgstr "MSE 量化会创建 INT4 或 INT8 权重表示。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:51
msgid ""
"calibrated methods use calibration data to produce GPTQ, AWQ, or "
"AutoRound outputs."
msgstr "校准方法会使用校准数据生成 GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 输出。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:52
msgid ""
"unselected source-quantized weights are preserved as BF16 when required "
"by the output policy."
msgstr "当输出策略要求时，未选中的源量化权重会以 BF16 保留。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:54
msgid ""
"Unsupported or unknown low-precision layouts are refused rather than "
"guessed."
msgstr "不支持或未知的低精度布局会被拒绝，而不是被猜测处理。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:56
msgid "Export phase"
msgstr "导出阶段"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:58
msgid ""
"Export writes a complete output model directory. Depending on the "
"operation, this may include:"
msgstr "导出会写入完整的输出模型目录。根据操作不同，这可能包括："

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:60
msgid "updated `config.json`."
msgstr "更新后的 `config.json`。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:61
msgid "`model.safetensors.index.json`."
msgstr "`model.safetensors.index.json`。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:62
msgid "generated `model-*.safetensors` shards."
msgstr "生成的 `model-*.safetensors` 分片。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:63
msgid "`quantization_manifest.json`."
msgstr "`quantization_manifest.json`。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:64
msgid "`quantization_report.json`."
msgstr "`quantization_report.json`。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:65
msgid "`conversion_report.json`."
msgstr "`conversion_report.json`。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:66
msgid "tokenizer and supporting files copied from the source."
msgstr "从源目录复制的 tokenizer 和支持文件。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:68
msgid ""
"The complete directory is the artifact. Individual shard files are not "
"enough for runtime loading."
msgstr "完整目录才是构件。单独的分片文件不足以进行运行时加载。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:70
msgid "Validation phase"
msgstr "验证阶段"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:72
msgid ""
"Validation checks consistency after export. It is designed to catch "
"structural and metadata errors before runtime testing."
msgstr "验证会在导出后检查一致性，用于在运行时测试之前捕获结构和元数据错误。"

#: ../../source/explanation/processing-pipeline.md:74
msgid ""
"Validation is not a substitute for inference loading, accuracy "
"evaluation, memory profiling, or throughput measurement."
msgstr "验证不能替代推理加载、精度评估、内存分析或吞吐量测量。"
